<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The `SilikoDataSourceDelete` function calls the delete function of a
`SiikoDataSource` object and then deletes the object.


* `Source` is the input source to advance. `Source` must be a value
  returned by `SiolikoDataSourceNew`.</para>
